# tests/

Integration tests for the UDEX datastore implementation. Covers PostgreSQL datastore functionality including index lifecycle, entry read/write operations, and context management under ST0009 (1:1 entry-context semantics).

## Files
- `postgres_integration_tests.rs` -- PostgreSQL integration tests for datastore operations; includes fixtures for indexes, contexts, and entry read/write operations
